<h1>11_时间纪元、阶段周期与空间方位 (Time, Eras, Intervals & Spatial Concepts)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本大类共 <b>70</b> 个高阶抽象概念词（分为 <b>4</b> 个折叠子表）• 支持右上角 <b>🇬🇧 英语 / 🇫🇷 法语（含冠词与阴阳性）</b> 一键切换</p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><span style='color:#a5b4fc;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01_时代、纪元、千禧年与历史时期 (5)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02_间隔、期限、瞬间与持久永恒 (10)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03_开端、巅峰、尾声与转折节点 (24)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04_维度、距离、范围、边界与方位概念 (31)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_时代、纪元、千禧年与历史时期 (Eras, Epochs, Centuries & Antiquity)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 5 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='20%'>抽象词 (英 / 法切换)</th><th width='13%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='21%'>中文释义</th><th width='21%'>英文精准定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='20%'>语境例句 & 同义思辨网</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>posterity</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la postérité<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 posterity</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/pɒ'steriti/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pɔsteʁite/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('posterity', 'la postérité')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 子孙, 后裔</td><td class='def-en'>all of the offspring of a given progenitor</td><td>2.97</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“we must secure the benefits of freedom for ourselves and our posterity”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>descendants</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> biological group</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>bygone</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la bygone<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 bygone</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'baigɒn/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/bygon/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('bygone', 'la bygone')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 过去的事, 往事</td><td class='def-en'>past events to be put aside</td><td>2.83</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“let bygones be bygones”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>water under the bridge</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> past</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>yore</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'yore<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 yore</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/jɔ:, jɔә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/yoʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('yore', 'l\'yore')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 从前, 往昔</td><td class='def-en'>time long past</td><td>2.64</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of yore (time long past).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> past</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>yesteryear</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le passé<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 yesteryear</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'jestәjiә(r)/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pase/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('yesteryear', 'le passé')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 去年, 不久以前</td><td class='def-en'>the time that has elapsed</td><td>2.62</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“forget the past”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>past</span><span class='syn-tag'>past times</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> time</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>offing</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'offing<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 offing</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'ɒ:fiŋ/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/offɛ̃g/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('offing', 'l\'offing')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 海面, 离岸距离</td><td class='def-en'>the near or foreseeable future</td><td>2.61</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“there was a wedding in the offing”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> future</div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02_间隔、期限、瞬间与持久永恒 (Intervals, Deadlines, Eternity & Duration)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 10 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='20%'>抽象词 (英 / 法切换)</th><th width='13%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='21%'>中文释义</th><th width='21%'>英文精准定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='20%'>语境例句 & 同义思辨网</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>frequency</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la fréquence<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 frequency</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'fri:kwәnsi/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/fʁekɑ̃s/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('frequency', 'la fréquence')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 频率, 频数</td><td class='def-en'>the number of occurrences within a given time period</td><td>4.36</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“the frequency of modulation was 40 cycles per second”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>frequence</span><span class='syn-tag'>oftenness</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> rate</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>infinity</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'infini<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 infinity</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/in'finiti/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛ̃fini/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('infinity', 'l\'infini')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 无限大, 无限</td><td class='def-en'>time without end</td><td>3.82</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of infinity (time without end).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>eternity</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> time</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>eternity</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'infini<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 eternity</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/i'tә:niti/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛ̃fini/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('eternity', 'l\'infini')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 永远, 来世, 不朽</td><td class='def-en'>time without end</td><td>3.8</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of eternity (time without end).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>infinity</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> time</div></div></td></tr>
